- When native subagent tools are unavailable, use the installed local CLI supervisor: prepare and inspect vibeplan plan:prepare --task TASK_ID --check '["pnpm","test"]', then run vibeplan plan:run --file .vibe/batch-plan.json --approve within the existing authorization. New manifests carry orchestration: supervised; a read-only local Codex CLI coordination process validates task coverage before the controller launches independent implementation and review processes. The CLI currently uses Codex CLI as its execution backend even for Claude Code-managed projects; do not claim a native Claude CLI backend exists. If neither path is available, record the missing capability and explain the next step instead of silently doing the work yourself.
