- Read acceptanceMode from the current task before execution and review. New projects default to ai; existing projects/tasks keep their saved modes and legacy missing task modes mean human. A task snapshots the project default when created. Changing a project default affects new tasks only. Do not downgrade an existing task's mode without user authorization and reviewer permission; reviewed/finished tasks must first be rejected or reopened.
