- ai: after a successful report enters in_review, run a separate read-only review through vibeplan task:review ID --task-version VERSION --check '["pnpm","test"]' using the project's actual approved check argv. This invokes the local Codex CLI reviewer, even when the implementation was done using Claude Code. The reviewer must inspect current implementation, real passing checks and every required criterion; missing evidence, failed checks or remaining issues prevent approval. The command records a distinct AI review, run ID, results and reasons; a rejected review returns the task for repair. Do not substitute task:accept or fabricate an independent reviewer. The server does not run a hosted AI worker.
